er-card__type--compute\" href=\"https://godotshaders.com/shader/?shader_type=compute&#038;pg=1\" data-gds-filter-link=\"1\" data-tax=\"shader_type\" data-slug=\"compute\">COMPUTE</a><div class=\"gds-shader-card__stats\"><div class=\"gds-shader-card__stat gds-shader-card__like\" aria-label=\"Likes\"><svg class=\"gds-shader-card__icon gds-shader-card__icon--heart\" viewBox=\"0 0 17 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M8.3 15.2305L7.0965 14.1349C2.822 10.2588 0 7.6941 0 4.565C0 2.0003 2.0086 0 4.565 0C6.0092 0 7.3953 0.6723 8.3 1.7264C9.2047 0.6723 10.5908 0 12.035 0C14.5914 0 16.6 2.0003 16.6 4.565C16.6 7.6941 13.778 10.2588 9.5035 14.1349L8.3 15.2305Z\"/></svg><span class=\"gds-shader-card__stat-num\">16</span></div><div class=\"gds-shader-card__stat\" aria-label=\"Comments\"><svg class=\"gds-shader-card__icon gds-shader-card__icon--comment\" viewBox=\"0 0 17 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M2.6975 0C1.98208 0 1.29596 0.2842 0.790079 0.790079C0.2842 1.29596 0 1.98208 0 2.6975V9.7525C0 10.4679 0.2842 11.154 0.790079 11.6599C1.29596 12.1658 1.98208 12.45 2.6975 12.45H3.32V14.7325C3.32 15.5874 4.296 16.0754 4.98 15.5625L9.13 12.45H13.9025C14.2567 12.45 14.6075 12.3802 14.9347 12.2447C15.262 12.1091 15.5594 11.9104 15.8099 11.6599C16.0604 11.4094 16.2591 11.1121 16.3947 10.7848C16.5302 10.4575 16.6 10.1067 16.6 9.7525V2.6975C16.6 2.34326 16.5302 1.99249 16.3947 1.66521C16.2591 1.33794 16.0604 1.04057 15.8099 0.790079C15.5594 0.539593 15.262 0.340897 14.9347 0.205335C14.6075 0.0697729 14.2567 0 13.9025 0H2.6975Z\"/></svg><span class=\"gds-shader-card__stat-num\">3</span></div></div></div></article>",
